BaseConfigLib::hasAnyTargetCheck
├── given no target fields enabled
│   └── it should return false
├── given only RECIPIENT enabled
│   └── it should return true
├── given only FILL_EXPIRY enabled
│   └── it should return true
├── given only TOKEN_OUT enabled
│   └── it should return true
├── given only RECIPIENT_IS_SPONSOR enabled
│   └── it should return true
└── given multiple target fields enabled
    └── it should return true